{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"raspberry-pi-enclosure-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"PI03-SOURCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/prompt.txt","locator":"research request","sha256":"d87456d36c03bec64d6fb60d270cdefc6d1e0cc132bf4c06efd544a529dece28"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Source research and interface rules","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Board/connectors/cooling use pinned manufacturer Pi 5 evidence; the nominal silhouette and synthetic fan curve remain explicitly separate and unresolved vendor dimensions are listed."},{"id":"PI03-ENCLOSURE","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Source research and interface rules","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Both variants preserve the 145×110×48 mm envelope, 2.5 mm walls, 22 mm rear cable channel, light opening, four underside fasteners, service tabs and declared 0.30 mm unvalidated tab clearance."},{"id":"PI03-LOADS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/thermal-loads.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"2c849a774d6d171fa666119c27da24dd02a33962611853044dee2700a6593663"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Flow and heat model","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Matched models use 30 °C ambient and exact 9 W/2 W source geometries mapped from board-local thermal-loads.csv with shell k=0.20 W/(m·K)."},{"id":"PI03-FAN","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/fan-curve.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"87bfc228d5016328da784b716cfbdef0910ab1acac685936f1116e4feebe3f71"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Flow and heat model","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Both variants use the same 30×30×10 mm fan envelope and monotonic interpolation of every supplied pressure/flow point; constant velocity is only a separately labeled bounded fallback."},{"id":"PI03-VARIANTS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Flow and heat model","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Each has 900 mm² nominal inlet/outlet; A is straight-through and B adds a 1.5 mm curved guide with ≥4 mm board/component clearance and no lid contact."},{"id":"PI03-CFD","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-vision-instrument/context.md","locator":"Flow and heat model","sha256":"e07e0cd4d790bf95982ffb7960fff231f78e34284597ebc60633729370c1c30e"}],"text":"Comparable actual fields, convergence, heat balance and pressure/flow summaries evaluate below-68 °C patch temperature and lowest practical pressure loss."},{"id":"PI03-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/raspberry-pi-enclosure/03-edge-visio